":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気軽に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とは言えないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも気になったらぜひ遊びに来てください〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobqzF21D.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobRyinlD.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜びます🐰🖤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15th Single期間も、よろしくお願いいたします🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝又 春　#38"}],"source":"official"},"crw-nogi-13040":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに生駒ちゃんは銀魂みたの２度目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーーーーーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね近々もっかい観に行こうって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お約束したーあ(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも２度観たいと思ったのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてだねふむふむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒てぃんに関しては３度になるねふむふむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、今日はこの後ロケが入った故に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お買い物ができなかったのだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからね、今度いく時はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画みたあとにお買い物しておそろっちの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か買おうね♡って約束したの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え？待って脳内かも......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや...そん、なはずは...たぶん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒てぃんもそう、言って、た...はず..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/07/18/3892730/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(このような場合、イェーガーとは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デートという意味合いになるのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅぺでぃあ調べ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう銀さんのシャーペンおそろっちで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲッチュしたんだけどね(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅの目がハートになっちゃったん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどね(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...よーし帰って撮り溜めてるアニメみよ。ずん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/07/18/3892730/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだNOGIBINGO！さん収録のあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後っち樋口っちと一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたままつりとやらに行ってきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり人混みに耐えきれず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１周してちょびっと食料を買って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木陰で食べて帰りました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、嘘ですそのあと渋谷へ行きましたw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでプリクラ撮ってたら急に大和さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乱入してきて能條さんと和田さんが合流して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい靴を買って大和さんとばいばいして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田さんとばいばいして川後さんのお家に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お泊まりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら一実さんが遊びにきてわあわあして(詳しくは後日(一実ブログ))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず楽しみました(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊んでばっかなわけじゃないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫だよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/07/18/3892730/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュッシュするぞこらー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ皆の衆、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんちゃんとデートがしたく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なったかえ？かえかえ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私？...あぁ、私は嫌だね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんたんめんどくさいもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふはははは、ぐわっはははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、２期生の北野日奈子ちゃんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログにあしゅさんの名前がでてましたー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅさん...さん......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きーちゃんと、よく連絡とってるの＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけどお誕生日おめでとうね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度あーそぼー写真とーろうーね(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやたんとらぶらぶ電話うぃる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んちゃっっ"}],"source":"archive"}